<title>CZECH REPUBLIC: Czech cen bank o/n repo avg yield 16.31 pct.</title>
<headline>Czech cen bank o/n repo avg yield 16.31 pct.</headline>
<dateline>PRAGUE 1997-07-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Czech National Bank (CNB) said the average rate in its overnight repo tender adding liquidity to the local money market reached 16.31 percent.</p>
<p>The limit rate set by the CNB on bids was 16.30 percent. The overnight Prague interbank offered rate was quoted at 16.7 percent in morning trading.</p>
<p>-- Prague Newsroom, 420-2-2423-0003</p>
